{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0088-s002", "text": "Mobbning innebär att en elev upprepade gånger orsakas skada eller dåligt mående.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0088-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.264129638671875, "generation_seconds": 21.72970290412195, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0088-s003", "text": "Förövarna kan vara någon eller några som den mobbade har svårt att försvara sig mot.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0088-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.301239013671875, "generation_seconds": 19.129451997112483, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0088-s004", "text": "Mobbning är medveten och förknippad med maktutövning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0088-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.3482666015625, "generation_seconds": 16.932894516037777, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0088-s005", "text": "Eleven till exempel skräms, hotas, kallas vid öknamn eller skadas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0088-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.340728759765625, "generation_seconds": 20.695345441810787, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0089-s001", "text": "Det är också mobbning eller diskriminering om en elev upprepade gånger lämnas utanför gruppen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0089-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.257659912109375, "generation_seconds": 27.000054290983826, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0089-s002", "text": "Vid mobbning är det ofta fråga om ett gruppfenomen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0089-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.23223876953125, "generation_seconds": 18.309450133005157, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0089-s003", "text": "Om mobbningen sker i skolan eller på skolvägen, ska föräldrarna och barnet genast informera läraren och skolans rektor om det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0089-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.866938775510205, "peak": 0.298065185546875, "generation_seconds": 29.581168374046683, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0089-s004", "text": "Skolorna är skyldiga att ingripa i mobbning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025325883027+0000-12/hb-c08-u0089-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.270294189453125, "generation_seconds": 10.483925580978394, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
